OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who lost dad and sister to
OL,4,ACovid doubts inquiry will bring change
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who lost her father and sister
OL,7,Fwithin five days of each other during
OL,8,Fthe first Covid lockdown said she has
OL,9,Fno faith that the findings of an
OL,10,Fofficial inquiry into the outbreak in
OL,11,Fcare homes will lead to change.
OL,13,FThe sixth report from the Covid
OL,14,Finquiry, released on Tuesday, found
OL,15,Fthat government failures in care
OL,16,Fsettings created an environment that
OL,17,Fallowed the virus to spread.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
