OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who lost dad and sister to
OL,4,ACovid doubts inquiry will bring change
OL,5,
OL,6,FJane Roche, from Castle Vale in
OL,7,FBirmingham, was unable to visit her
OL,8,Ffather, Vincent Pettitt, who had
OL,9,Fdementia, because of Covid
OL,10,Frestrictions. He died in hospital two
OL,11,Fweeks later in April 2020.
OL,13,FShe said she knew her 86-year-old
OL,14,Ffather needed her, which left her
OL,15,Ffeeling devastated.
